DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       yyuuvvttooppppmm  reads  raw Abekas YUV bytes as input and produces a PPM image
       as output.  The input file is just YUV bytes.  You have to specify  the
       width and height on the command line, since the program obviously can't
       get them from the file.  yyuuvvoottppppmm assumes the maxval of  the  input  is
       255.

       The ppppmmttooyyuuvv mmaannuuaall(1) tells a little about the Abekas YUV format.


